

>> usedMemory1 := 0.
>> usedMemory2 := 0.
>> usedMemory3 := 0.
>> usedMemory4 := 0.

>> x := 100.

ပရိုဂရမ် မှတ်ဉာဏ်စီမံ: 0.

{
>> txt := ['hello '] + ['world'].
txt := txt + [' - can we use strings.. '].
txt := txt + ['without leaking '] + x + ['s of bytes ?'].
txt အဆုံးတွင်ထည့်: ['!!'].
အထွက် ရေး: txt.
} စတင်.

ပရိုဂရမ် သန့်ရှင်း.

usedMemory1 := (ပရိုဂရမ် မှတ်ဉာဏ် ? 0).


{
>> txt := ['hello '] + ['world'].
txt := txt + [' - can we use strings.. '].
txt := txt + ['without leaking '] + x + ['s of bytes ?'].
txt အဆုံးတွင်ထည့်: ['!!'].
